# Chat 19: 4:10 with its three kill counters (0x4A39-0x4A3B: each fight adds the monsters it put down, 0x6DC8, and
# 5 more after some fights) past 249, as a party that has fought long in the graveyard has them: the clamps
# (0xA616, 0xA814, 0xAB31, 0xB29C, 0xB2B2, 0xB2C8: over 249, set 249) then run. The events holding them
# (15, 18, 22, 28) are each run directly, the party placed on the square and LOOKing (the step script runs): a
# byte add wraps, and on any walk there the wandering skeletons (0x9CE1 adds their kills) take the counters past
# 255 first. Event 15's clamp (0xA616) came from a walk.
rules playthrough.plan
start chat13a_latest/zhentil
travel 4:10
expect 4:10
shortcut flag 4A39 set 250 the kill counter after long fighting
shortcut flag 4A3A set 250 the kill counter after long fighting
shortcut flag 4A3B set 250 the kill counter after long fighting
shortcut teleport 4:10 4,10 N event 18's square
key l
shortcut flag 4A39 set 250 the kill counter after long fighting
shortcut flag 4A3A set 250 the kill counter after long fighting
shortcut flag 4A3B set 250 the kill counter after long fighting
shortcut teleport 4:10 9,7 N event 22's square
key l
shortcut flag 4A39 set 250 the kill counter after long fighting
shortcut flag 4A3A set 250 the kill counter after long fighting
shortcut flag 4A3B set 250 the kill counter after long fighting
shortcut teleport 4:10 14,0 N event 28's square
